<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>911 GT3 RS — Porsche</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --porsche-red: #D5001C;
            --porsche-red-dim: rgba(213, 0, 28, 0.08);
            --black: #000000;
            --void: #050505;
            --charcoal: #0a0a0a;
            --graphite: #111111;
            --iron: #1a1a1a;
            --steel: #2a2a2a;
            --ash: #555555;
            --silver: #888888;
            --platinum: #aaaaaa;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --cream: #f0f0f0;
            --ease-out-expo: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; font-size: 16px; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background: var(--black);
            color: var(--white);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }
        ::selection { background: var(--porsche-red); color: var(--white); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--void); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--porsche-red); border-radius: 2px; }

        /* LOADER */
        .loader {
            position: fixed; inset: 0; background: var(--black); z-index: 10000;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            transition: opacity 1.2s var(--ease-out-expo), visibility 1.2s;
        }
        .loader.done { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
        .loader-mark {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.35em;
            color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 3rem; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .loader-mark span { display: inline-block; transform: translateY(100%); }
        .loader-line-track { width: 120px; height: 1px; background: var(--iron); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .loader-line-fill { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; height: 100%; width: 0%; background: var(--porsche-red); }
        .loader-counter { position: absolute; bottom: 3rem; right: 3rem; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--ash); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

        /* NAV */
        .nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 1000; padding: 1.75rem 3rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; mix-blend-mode: difference; transition: padding 0.6s var(--ease-out-expo); }
        .nav.scrolled { padding: 1rem 3rem; }
        .nav-mark { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white); }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
        .nav-links a { font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; position: relative; padding-bottom: 4px; }
        .nav-links a::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--porsche-red); transition: width 0.5s var(--ease-out-expo); }
        .nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

        /* HERO */
        .hero { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100vh; min-height: 700px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--black); overflow: hidden; }
        .hero-grid { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 80px 80px; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 30%, transparent 70%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 30%, transparent 70%); }
        .hero-vignette { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, transparent 0%, var(--black) 70%); pointer-events: none; }

        .viewer { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 1400px; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .viewer-stage { position: relative; width: min(85vw, 1100px); height: min(55vh, 600px); perspective: 1500px; }
        .viewer-frame { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.92) translateY(20px); transition: opacity 0.9s var(--ease-out-expo), transform 0.9s var(--ease-out-expo); will-change: opacity, transform; }
        .viewer-frame.active { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
        .viewer-frame img { max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)); }
        .viewer-reflection { position: absolute; bottom: -60px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) scaleY(-1); width: 80%; height: 120px; opacity: 0.06; filter: blur(20px); pointer-events: none; }
        .viewer-glow { position: absolute; bottom: -30px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 500px; height: 60px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(213,0,28,0.12), transparent 70%); filter: blur(30px); pointer-events: none; }

        .data-layer { position: absolute; font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--silver); opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); transition: all 0.7s var(--ease-out-expo); pointer-events: none; z-index: 10; }
        .data-layer.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        .data-layer .data-num { display: block; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--white); margin-top: 0.4rem; line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        .data-layer .data-unit { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--porsche-red); font-weight: 700; margin-left: 0.3rem; }
        .data-layer .data-desc { display: block; font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ash); margin-top: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; max-width: 180px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .data-tl { top: 8%; left: 5%; }
        .data-tr { top: 8%; right: 5%; text-align: right; }
        .data-tr .data-desc { margin-left: auto; }
        .data-bl { bottom: 18%; left: 5%; }
        .data-br { bottom: 18%; right: 5%; text-align: right; }
        .data-br .data-desc { margin-left: auto; }

        .quote-layer { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); text-align: center; max-width: 700px; padding: 0 2rem; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1s var(--ease-out-expo); pointer-events: none; z-index: 5; }
        .quote-layer.visible { opacity: 1; }
        .quote-layer p { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem); font-weight: 200; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--cream); text-shadow: 0 4px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.9); letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
        .quote-layer .quote-src { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--porsche-red); }

        .viewer-controls { position: absolute; bottom: 50px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; z-index: 20; }
        .ctrl-btn { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--steel); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); color: var(--platinum); cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.4s var(--ease-out-expo); }
        .ctrl-btn:hover { border-color: var(--porsche-red); background: var(--porsche-red-dim); color: var(--white); transform: scale(1.08); }
        .ctrl-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: currentColor; }
        .ctrl-progress { position: relative; width: 56px; height: 56px; }
        .ctrl-progress svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
        .ctrl-progress-track { fill: none; stroke: var(--iron); stroke-width: 1.5; }
        .ctrl-progress-bar { fill: none; stroke: var(--porsche-red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-dasharray: 163.36; stroke-dashoffset: 163.36; transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.3s linear; }
        .ctrl-frame-counter { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--silver); }

        .angle-indicator { position: absolute; bottom: 110px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; gap: 6px; z-index: 20; }
        .angle-dot { width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--steel); transition: all 0.4s var(--ease-out-expo); }
        .angle-dot.active { background: var(--porsche-red); width: 20px; border-radius: 2px; }

        .scroll-cue { position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; opacity: 0; }
        .scroll-cue span { font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash); }
        .scroll-cue-line { width: 1px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--porsche-red), transparent); }

        /* MANIFESTO */
        .manifesto { position: relative; padding: 16vh 0; background: var(--void); overflow: hidden; }
        .manifesto-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 3rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8rem; align-items: center; }
        .manifesto-label { font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--porsche-red); margin-bottom: 2rem; display: block; }
        .manifesto h2 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .manifesto h2 .dim { color: var(--ash); }
        .manifesto p { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--silver); max-width: 480px; }
        .manifesto-visual { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
        .manifesto-visual img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px; filter: grayscale(20%) contrast(1.1); }
        .manifesto-visual::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(213,0,28,0.08), transparent 60%); border-radius: 4px; pointer-events: none; }

        /* SPECS */
        .specs { position: relative; padding: 12vh 0; background: var(--black); overflow: hidden; }
        .specs-header { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 6vh; padding: 0 3rem; }
        .specs-header .label { font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--porsche-red); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: block; }
        .specs-header h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .specs-header h2 span { color: var(--ash); }
        .specs-track { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 0 3rem; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scrollbar-width: none; -ms-overflow-style: none; }
        .specs-track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .spec-card { flex: 0 0 320px; background: var(--graphite); border: 1px solid var(--iron); border-radius: 2px; padding: 2.5rem; scroll-snap-align: start; transition: all 0.5s var(--ease-out-expo); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .spec-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--porsche-red), transparent); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.5s; }
        .spec-card:hover { border-color: rgba(213,0,28,0.3); transform: translateY(-6px); }
        .spec-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
        .spec-card-num { font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--porsche-red); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: block; }
        .spec-card-label { font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        .spec-card-value { font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        .spec-card-value span { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--porsche-red); font-weight: 600; margin-left: 0.2rem; }
        .spec-card-desc { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--silver); margin-top: 1rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--iron); }

        /* ENGINEERING */
        .engineering { position: relative; background: var(--void); }
        .eng-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 100vh; align-items: center; }
        .eng-row:nth-child(even) { direction: rtl; }
        .eng-row:nth-child(even) > * { direction: ltr; }
        .eng-media { position: relative; height: 100%; min-height: 60vh; overflow: hidden; }
        .eng-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 1.2s var(--ease-out-expo); }
        .eng-media:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }
        .eng-media::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--void) 0%, transparent 30%, transparent 70%, var(--void) 100%); pointer-events: none; }
        .eng-content { padding: 5rem 4rem; max-width: 560px; }
        .eng-index { font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--porsche-red); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: block; }
        .eng-title { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .eng-body { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--silver); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .eng-specs { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; }
        .eng-spec { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; }
        .eng-spec-val { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--white); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        .eng-spec-label { font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash); }

        /* QUOTE */
        .quote-block { padding: 16vh 3rem; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--void), var(--black), var(--void)); }
        .quote-block blockquote { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .quote-block p { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 200; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .quote-block cite { font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--porsche-red); font-style: normal; }

        /* CONTACT */
        .contact { position: relative; padding: 14vh 3rem; background: var(--black); }
        .contact-inner { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .contact-label { font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--porsche-red); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: block; }
        .contact h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .contact-sub { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--silver); margin-bottom: 4rem; }
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; position: relative; }
        .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
        .form-group input, .form-group textarea, .form-group select { width: 100%; padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem; background: var(--graphite); border: 1px solid var(--iron); border-radius: 2px; color: var(--white); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 400; transition: all 0.4s var(--ease-out-expo); outline: none; }
        .form-group input::placeholder, .form-group textarea::placeholder { color: var(--steel); }
        .form-group input:focus, .form-group textarea:focus, .form-group select:focus { border-color: var(--porsche-red); background: rgba(213,0,28,0.02); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(213,0,28,0.06); }
        .form-group textarea { min-height: 140px; resize: vertical; }
        .form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
        .submit-btn { width: 100%; padding: 1.3rem; background: var(--porsche-red); border: none; border-radius: 2px; color: var(--white); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.5s var(--ease-out-expo); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .submit-btn::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: -100%; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), transparent); transition: left 0.7s var(--ease-out-expo); }
        .submit-btn:hover::before { left: 100%; }
        .submit-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(213,0,28,0.35); }
        .submit-btn.sent { background: #1a5c2a; pointer-events: none; }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer { padding: 4rem 3rem; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--iron); background: var(--void); }
        footer .mark { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.35em; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--white); }
        footer p { font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--ash); letter-spacing: 0.15em; }

        /* AUDIO */
        .audio-btn { position: fixed; bottom: 2rem; right: 2rem; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--steel); background: var(--graphite); color: var(--silver); cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 1000; transition: all 0.4s var(--ease-out-expo); }
        .audio-btn:hover { border-color: var(--porsche-red); color: var(--white); transform: scale(1.1); }
        .audio-btn.active { background: var(--porsche-red); border-color: var(--porsche-red); color: var(--white); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(213,0,28,0.4); }
        .audio-btn svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; fill: currentColor; }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .manifesto-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
            .eng-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .eng-row:nth-child(even) { direction: ltr; }
            .eng-media { min-height: 40vh; }
            .eng-content { padding: 3rem 2rem; }
            .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .data-layer { display: none; }
            .viewer-stage { width: 95vw; }
        }
    </style>
<base target="_blank">
</head>
<body>

<!-- LOADER -->
<div class="loader" id="loader">
    <div class="loader-mark">
        <span>P</span><span>O</span><span>R</span><span>S</span><span>C</span><span>H</span><span>E</span>
    </div>
    <div class="loader-line-track">
        <div class="loader-line-fill" id="loaderFill"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="loader-counter" id="loaderCounter">00</div>
</div>

<!-- NAVIGATION -->
<nav class="nav" id="nav">
    <div class="nav-mark">Porsche</div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#hero">Inicio</a></li>
        <li><a href="#manifesto">Filosofia</a></li>
        <li><a href="#specs">Rendimiento</a></li>
        <li><a href="#engineering">Ingenieria</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Solicitar</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO / 360 VIEWER -->
<section class="hero" id="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid"></div>
    <div class="hero-vignette"></div>

    <div class="viewer">
        <div class="viewer-stage" id="viewerStage">
            <div class="viewer-frame active" data-frame="0">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/upload/image.jpeg" alt="Porsche 911 GT3 RS - Lateral izquierdo">
            </div>
            <div class="viewer-frame" data-frame="1">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/upload/image(1).jpeg" alt="Porsche 911 GT3 RS - Trasera 3/4">
            </div>
            <div class="viewer-frame" data-frame="2">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/upload/image(2).jpeg" alt="Porsche 911 GT3 RS - Frontal 3/4">
            </div>
            <div class="viewer-frame" data-frame="3">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/images/4_Porsche_GT3_RS_White_Eminence_Supercar.png" alt="Porsche 911 GT3 RS - Frontal">
            </div>
            <div class="viewer-frame" data-frame="4">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/images/6_Porsche_911_GT3_RS_2023_pictures.png" alt="Porsche 911 GT3 RS - Lateral derecho">
            </div>
            <div class="viewer-frame" data-frame="5">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/images/7_2022_Porsche_911_GT3_RS_completes.png" alt="Porsche 911 GT3 RS - Trasera">
            </div>
            <div class="viewer-frame" data-frame="6">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/images/2_Synonymous_with_intense_the_new_GT3.png" alt="Porsche 911 GT3 RS - Vista aerea">
            </div>
            <div class="viewer-frame" data-frame="7">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/images/5_Cockpit_and_interior_Porsche_Newsroo.png" alt="Porsche 911 GT3 RS - Interior">
            </div>

            <div class="viewer-reflection">
                <img src="/mnt/agents/upload/image.jpeg" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;">
            </div>
            <div class="viewer-glow"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="data-layer data-tl" id="d0">
            <span>Potencia maxima</span>
            <span class="data-num">525<span class="data-unit">CV</span></span>
            <span class="data-desc">A 8.500 rpm. Motor Boxer 4.0L atmosferico de 6 cilindros opuestos.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="data-layer data-tr" id="d1">
            <span>Aceleracion 0-100</span>
            <span class="data-num">3.2<span class="data-unit">s</span></span>
            <span class="data-desc">Cambio PDK de 7 velocidades con relaciones de circuito.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="data-layer data-bl" id="d2">
            <span>Par maximo</span>
            <span class="data-num">465<span class="data-unit">Nm</span></span>
            <span class="data-desc">A 6.300 rpm. Respuesta instantanea sin turbos de por medio.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="data-layer data-br" id="d3">
            <span>Velocidad maxima</span>
            <span class="data-num">296<span class="data-unit">km/h</span></span>
            <span class="data-desc">Aerodinamica activa con DRS. 860 kg de carga a 285 km/h.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="quote-layer" id="q0">
